libniji C library: configuration and programs
 libniji is an implementation of the GNU C Library's ABI (glibc $abi, x86-64).
 This package holds ldconfig, getconf, getent, iconv, ldd, locale, the
 loader configuration (/etc/ld.so.conf and /etc/ld.so.conf.d),
 /etc/gai.conf and the template of /etc/nsswitch.conf. The C library's
 localedef is not part of this build yet.
